{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin! Been a while, what's up? I'm tied up with car stuff lately, yesterday I came back from San Francsico with some great insights and knowledge on car modification that I want to share with you! Changing things around, and giving an old car a new life - so satisfying!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-a94942e7a2deced0aca46f7b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.411861+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a94942e7a2deced0aca46f7b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a94942e7a2deced0aca46f7b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! Nice to hear from you. That's cool! I totally understand the satisfaction you get from fixing cars. It's like you're giving them new life."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-908abc44d187f101117eab86", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.442336+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "908abc44d187f101117eab86", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "908abc44d187f101117eab86", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yeah, it's great fixing stuff up and seeing it turn out better. It's really rewarding and gives me a sense of purpose. Plus, it feels like I'm making a difference when I fix someone's car."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-bb240eb27a8fe5ad548ec7e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.460170+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bb240eb27a8fe5ad548ec7e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bb240eb27a8fe5ad548ec7e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, you must feel great making a real difference in someone's life, like being their superhero!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-907dc1ef15cc201cd0266764", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.477777+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "907dc1ef15cc201cd0266764", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "907dc1ef15cc201cd0266764", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yeah, it's great! It feels really good to make a difference and see their relief when their car is fixed. Makes me proud!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-968a5dba2c58ad07b87ec1a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.491701+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "968a5dba2c58ad07b87ec1a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "968a5dba2c58ad07b87ec1a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, Dave, that's awesome! You should be really proud of yourself for bringing joy to others. I booked a flight ticket to Boston last week! I'm so excited about my upcoming trip to Boston. Look at this! See you soon, buddy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-ce2dbe01b4da02195fe8c180", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.507776+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce2dbe01b4da02195fe8c180", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce2dbe01b4da02195fe8c180", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Cool! Let me know when you're free and we can catch up in Boston."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-75c167adde3658215d50df69", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.523162+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "75c167adde3658215d50df69", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "75c167adde3658215d50df69", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, for sure! I'll let you know when I'm in Boston. See you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-644c3854a2284ff8c002a0e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.538809+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "644c3854a2284ff8c002a0e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "644c3854a2284ff8c002a0e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Looking forward to seeing you! Have a safe trip, see ya!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-1943f908391b8753e48ff0c9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.552571+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1943f908391b8753e48ff0c9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1943f908391b8753e48ff0c9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! Gotta stay safe on the trip. Can't wait to see you there! I will contact you when I arrive. Goodbye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_17-b4d3bf2ad2f7278a1a672b1d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:06.569531+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4d3bf2ad2f7278a1a672b1d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4d3bf2ad2f7278a1a672b1d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
